Elizabeth Presentation: Working with batches of PDF files: Dariah Topics Explorer 
- Topic modelling: a data mining method for distant reading 
- NOT an objective method of research! Should treat it as a method of discovery. Don't let an algorithm tell you what something means. We are historians - we decide that. 
- Topic modelling relies on calculations, its all about the liklihood words will show up together. All about probability
        - Using topic modelling can often say more about how the tool works/what the tool does to the data, than about the              actual data itself****
